#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot of the Emoticons Theme Manager"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana upravitelja tema emotikona"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Emoticons Theme Manager"
msgstr "Upravitelj tema emotikona"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Emoticons can be used in several &kde; applications: &kopete;, "
"&konversation;, &kmail;... This module offers you to easily manage your "
"emoticons sets. You can:"
msgstr ""
"Emotikoni mogu biti korišteni u nekoliko &kde; aplikacija: &kopete;, "
"&konversation;, &kmail;... Ovaj modul Vam omogućava da jednostavno podesite "
"emotikone. Možete:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "add emoticons themes"
msgstr "dodati temu emotikona"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "remove emoticons themes"
msgstr "ukloniti temu emotikona"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "install an existing theme"
msgstr "instalirati postojeću temu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "add, remove or edit emoticons within a theme"
msgstr "dodati, ukloniti ili promijeniti emotikone unutar teme"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "Please note that you will set emoticons themes per application."
msgstr "Imate na umu da podešavate teme emotikona za aplikacije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The module is separated in two parts: on the left you can manage your themes "
"and on the right you can manage emoticons within themes."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul je podijeljen na dva dijela: lijevo možete upravljati temama, a "
"desno možete upravljati emotikonima unutar teme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An emoticon consists in two parts: an icon (typically a <filename>.png</"
"filename>, <filename>.mng</filename> or <filename>.gif</filename> picture) "
"and a text describing the emoticon. The text can be some ASCII symbols like "
"<userinput>]:-></userinput> or the emoticon short description enclosed "
"within <userinput>*</userinput> like <userinput>*FRIEND*</userinput>. The "
"user types the symbol or the text and the emoticon icon replaces it."
msgstr ""
"Emotikoni se sastoje od dva dijela: ikona (Tipično slika formata <filename>."
"png</filename>, <filename>.mng</filename> ili <filename>.gif</filename>) i "
"teksta koji opisuje emotikon. Tekst mogu biti neki ASCII simboli kao što su "
"<userinput>]:-></userinput> ili kratki opis emotikona ograničen znakom "
"<userinput>*</userinput> , kao <userinput>*PRIJATELJ*</userinput>. Korisnik "
"ukucava simbol ili tekst i ikona emotikona ga mijenja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The emoticons themes will be saved locally in your home in <filename class="
"\"directory\">$KDEHOME/share/emoticons</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Teme emotikona će biti snimljene lokalno na <filename class=\"directory\">"
"$KDEHOME/share/emoticons</filename>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "Emoticons Themes"
msgstr "Teme emotikona"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "This section allows you to manage emoticons themes."
msgstr "Ova sekcija vam omogućava da podesite teme emotikona."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Require spaces around emoticons"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj razmake oko emotikona"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this option is checked, you need to separate the emoticon with a white "
"space before and after it so it is changed to an icon. If you type "
"\"Hello:-)\" then this string will stay as it is while if you type "
"\"Hello :-)\" you will get \"Hello\" followed by the :-) emoticon."
msgstr ""
"Kada je ova opcija označena, morate odvojiti emotikon branim mjestom prije i "
"poslije njega da bi se promijenila u ikonu. Ako ukucate \"Hello:-)\" onda će "
"string ostati kakav jeste, a ako ukucate \"Hello :-)\" dobit ćete \"Hello\" "
"praćen sa :-) emotikonom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this option is not checked (default), each emoticon string will be "
"replaced by its icon."
msgstr ""
"Kada ova opcija nije označena (zadano), svaki string koji predstavlja "
"emotikon će biti zamijenjen svojom ikonom."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "New Theme..."
msgstr "Nova tema..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can create your own new theme from scratch. Clicking on this button "
"brings a dialog asking for the name of the new theme. You can then use the "
"<guibutton>Add...</guibutton> button on the right to create new emoticons "
"and their associated text."
msgstr ""
"Možete kreirati sopstvenu novu temu iz skice. Klik na ovo dugme Vam otvara "
"okvir koji traži da unesete ime nove teme. Možete koristiti dugme "
"<guibutton>Dodaj..</guibutton> desno da kreirate novi emotikon sa pratećim "
"tekstom."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Get New Icon Themes..."
msgstr "Dobavi nove teme ikona..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You need to be connected to the Internet to use this action. A dialog "
"displays a list of emoticons themes from <ulink url=\"http://www.kde-look.org"
"\">http://www.kde-look.org</ulink> and you can install one by clicking the "
"<guibutton>Install</guibutton> button on the right side of the theme "
"description in the list."
msgstr ""
"Trebate biti spojeni na internet da koristite ovu opciju. Ovaj okvir "
"prikazuje listu tema emotikona  sa <ulink url=\"http://www.kde-look.org"
"\">http://www.kde-look.org</ulink> i možete instalirati jednu klikom na "
"dugme <guibutton>Instalirati</guibutton> na desnoj strani opisa teme u listi."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Install Theme File..."
msgstr "Instaliraj datoteku teme..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This action allows you to install a theme you downloaded yourself. A theme "
"file is an archive file, usually a <filename>.tar.gz</filename> or a "
"<filename>.zip</filename> file or any other archive files. A dialog asks you "
"for the location of this local archive file and after you entered or dragged "
"the URL and clicked <guibutton>OK</guibutton>, the theme is installed and "
"will appear in the themes list."
msgstr ""
"Ova akcija dozvoljava da instalirate temu koju ste sami preuzeli. Datoteka "
"teme je arhivski dokument, obično  <filename>.tar.gz</filename> ili "
"<filename>.zip</filename> dokument ili neki drugi. Okvir Vas pita za "
"lokaciju ovog arhivskog dokumenta i nakon što unesete ili prevučete URL i "
"kliknete na <guibutton>OK</guibutton>, tema će biti instalirana i pojavit će "
"se u listi tema."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remove Theme"
msgstr "Ukloni Temu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This action will remove the selected theme from your disk. Select the theme "
"you want to remove in the list. Click the <guibutton>Remove Theme</"
"guibutton> button. This theme will be removed from the disk if you click "
"<guibutton>Apply</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Ova akcija će ukloniti selektovanu temu sa diska. Odaberite iz liste temu "
"koju želite ukloniti. Kliknite na dugme <guibutton>Ukloni temu</guibutton>. "
"Tema će biti uklonjena sa diska ako kliknete na <guibutton>Primijeni</"
"guibutton>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid "Emoticons Management"
msgstr "Upravljač emotikonima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This section allows you to manage emoticons within the selected theme. The "
"list on the right displays all emoticons of the selected theme. You can add, "
"edit or remove any emoticon. Select a theme in the list on the left and then "
"select the action you want to perform."
msgstr ""
"Ova sekcija Vam omogućava da upravljate emotikonima unutar selektovane teme. "
"Lista desno prikazuje sve emotikone odabrane teme. Možete dodati, "
"promijeniti ili ukloniti bilo koji emotikon. Odaberite temu u listi lijevo i "
"onda odaberite akciju koju želite primijenili."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "Add..."
msgstr "Dodaj..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This button allows you to add an emoticon to the selected theme. The dialog "
"asks you to choose an icon for your emoticon and to enter the corresponding "
"ASCII symbol or text attached to it. After that, clicking <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> will add your new emoticon in the emoticon list, you will see the "
"icon and the corresponding text displayed. If you want to modify either the "
"icon or the text, you can use the <guibutton>Edit...</guibutton> button "
"described below."
msgstr ""
"Ovo dugme Vam omogućava da dodate emotikon u odabranu temu. Okvir traži od "
"Vas da odaberete ikonu za emotikon i da uneste odgovarajući ASCII simbol ili "
"tekst koji se vezuje uz nju. Nakon toga, klik na <guibutton>OK</guibutton> "
"će dodati novi emotikon u listu emotikona, i bit će prikazan odgovarajući "
"tekst. Ako želite podesiti bilo ikonu ili tekst, možete koristiti dugme "
"<guibutton>Izmijeni...</guibutton> opisano ispod."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "Edit..."
msgstr "Izmijeni..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Edit...</guibutton> button allows you to change either the "
"icon or the text of the selected emoticon. You need to click the "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to validate this action."
msgstr ""
"Dugme <guibutton>Izmijeni...</guibutton> Vam omogućava da promijenite bilo "
"ikonu bilo tekst vezan uz odabrani emotikon. Trebate kliknuti na  "
"<guibutton>U redu</guibutton> dugme da potvrdite ovu akciju."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Ukloni"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will remove the selected emoticon from the selected theme. You need to "
"click the <guibutton>Yes</guibutton> button to validate this action."
msgstr ""
"Ovo će ukloniti odabrani emotikon iz odabrane teme. Trebate kliknuti na "
"dugme  <guibutton>Da</guibutton> da biste potvrdili ovu akciju."
